This page provides a listing of current collaborations, tasks, and news about English Wikipedia. New to  [LINK: (Wikipedia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia] ? See the  [LINK: (contributing to Wikipedia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Contributing_to_Wikipedia]  page or  [LINK: (our tutorial) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Introduction]  for everything you need to know to get started. For a listing of  [LINK: (internal project pages) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:ADMINP]  of interest, see the  [LINK: (department directory) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Department_directory] .


# INTERACT MORE #

For a listing of ongoing discussions and current requests, see the  [LINK: (Dashboard) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Dashboard] .


# COMMUNITY BULLETIN BOARD #

Before editing, make sure you are on  [LINK: (Wikipedia:Community bulletin board) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Community_bulletin_board] , not Wikipedia:Community portal, where the board is transcluded.

Events and projects: In this section, only organized events, projects, and/or competitions should be listed. These are organized by how often they occur:
The Yearly section is for uncommon events, like events that only occur every year, once, or irregularly. The Monthly section is for events that occur each month, or are always ongoing.

The Yearly section is for uncommon events, like events that only occur every year, once, or irregularly. The Monthly section is for events that occur each month, or are always ongoing.

WikiProject notices: In this section, any announcement, request for help or other notice from a WikiProject should be listed here.
Entries should be signed, and ordered from newest to oldest.
Entries are to be removed after a period of 6 months.

Entries should be signed, and ordered from newest to oldest.

Entries are to be removed after a period of 6 months.

Welcome to the community bulletin board, which is a page used for announcements from  [LINK: (WikiProjects) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Wikiproject]  and other groups. Included here are coordinated efforts, events, projects, and other general announcements.

